      "mergeID": "6ae361e8fad6ef4ff650c1f0",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It was stated a long time ago it would be brought back, but it hasn't. Recently 8k pictures were made possible with minimum lag and still no panorama pictures. \nCan we have this back now?\nPanorama pictures were very effective way of capturing not a small scene of a world. Rather nearly the entire moment. This could make for some beautiful moments on club worlds with everyone surrounding the camera.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Bring back panorama pictures",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62e4aa4f85365344b76d7aff",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah I frequently took Panorama shots instead of screenshots as its honestly much easier to just snap one of them and, capture the general vibe, vs point and aim a camera and try to frame something together that explains what is going on in the moment.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
