      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6ae362688fa773e9506dbe8a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "There used to be a panorama button in the camera menu (along with a vrchive panorama button) that now appear to be missing. Please reimplement these features (or at least the regular panorama).\nI have read the patch notes and understand there were issues with it currently, so it was removed. I'm making this request mainly so that myself and others can voice their desire for it to come back (so that this feature doesn't become another case of Web Panel).",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Bring back the ability to take Panoramas",
